# Build context exclusions for the react-app image.
#
# CRITICAL: node_modules must be excluded. The Dockerfile does `COPY . .` and then
# `npm ci` inside the image. Copying a host node_modules directory both bloats the
# build context and fails outright when the host tree contains platform-specific
# symlinks (e.g. .bin/acorn), producing:
#   ERROR: failed to symlink .../node_modules/.bin/acorn: no such file or directory
node_modules
npm-debug.log*

# Build output — regenerated by `npm run build` inside the image.
dist
dist-ssr

# VCS / tooling
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore

# Local env and secrets (never bake into an image)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.local

# Docs
*.md
